+   * will be a multiple of 480 samples: 480 or 960 samples,
+   * depending on the framesize (30 or 60 ms).
+   *
+   * Input:
+   *      - ISAC_main_inst    : ISAC instance.
+   *      - encoded           : encoded ISAC frame(s)
+   *      - len               : bytes in encoded vector
