+ * Arithmetic coding of spectrum.
+ *
+ * Input:
+ *      - streamData        : in-/output struct containing bitstream
+ *      - dataQ7            : data vector in Q7
+ *      - envQ8             : side info vector defining the width of the pdf
+ *                            in Q8
+ *      - lenData           : data vector length
